ityBold&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;AbilityScore&#174;&lt;/strong&gt;, the world’s first patented universal child development score, parents see their child’s mind with clarity — just as the Sri Chakra reveals hidden geometry .&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;•Through &lt;strong data-entity-type=&quot;MessageEntityBold&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;TherapeuticAI&#174;&lt;/strong&gt;, the world’s first autism-focused AI, every session adapts in real time — guiding children with the precision of Devi’s bow and arrows &amp;nbsp;.&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;•Across &lt;strong data-entity-type=&quot;MessageEntityBold&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;19 million+ therapy sessions&lt;/strong&gt;, Pinnacle has restored the harmony of childhood for families, with &lt;strong data-entity-type=&quot;MessageEntityBold&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;97\%+ proven improvements&lt;/strong&gt; .&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;blob:http://localhost:3000/7e539135-257b-481b-8d44-031bc82130ef&quot; alt=&quot;&#127802;&quot; draggable=&quot;false&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border-style: none; flex-shrink: 0; width: 20px; height: 20px; margin-inline-end: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: 0\% 0\% / 20px no-repeat; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none;&quot; class=&quot;fr-fic fr-dii&quot;&gt; Just as Lalita Devi binds with devotion and directs with compassion, Pinnacle&#174; nurtures every child’s speech, behavior, cognition, and emotions — ensuring &lt;strong data-entity-type=&quot;MessageEntityBold&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;hope for parents, trust for families, and growth for humanity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;blob:http://localhost:3000/3eeda0ed-1686-4f11-953a-890b12995930&quot; alt=&quot;&#127757;&quot; draggable=&quot;false&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border-style: none; flex-shrink: 0; width: 20px; height: 20px; margin-inline-end: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: 0\% 0\% / 20px no-repeat; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none;&quot; class=&quot;fr-fic fr-dii&quot;&gt; From Bharat to the world, Pinnacle&#174; is the &lt;strong data-entity-type=&quot;MessageEntityBold&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;living reflection of Lalita Tripura Sundari Amma’s blessings&lt;/strong&gt; — making science a mirror, therapy a balance, and every child’s voice finally heard.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-radius: 1.125rem; opacity: 1; background-color: rgba(74, 142, 58, 0.55); transition: opacity 150ms; right: -3rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&#39;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; title=&quot;Forward&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; touch-action: manipulation; border-radius: 50\%; appearance: button; margin: 0px; font-